{"id": "dfead8a8-958a-475e-b673-90b11ad6763c", "slug": "aero-creative-engine-3", "title": "AERO - Creative Engine", "description": "Aero Creative UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"AERO - Creative Engine\"\ndescription: \"Aero Creative UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F0411A\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#F0411A\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#222222\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Arial\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Arial\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# AERO - Creative Engine\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 33; favorites: 5; remixes: 2.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, threejs, security, navigation.\n## Overview\nAero Creative UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nFramework Architecture Showcase Initialize AERO Built for Velocity Transform Workflows, Logic, and Output. Redefine the Standard. Explore an infinite environment where advanced algorithms merge with fluid design. Archit…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Transform Workflows, Logic, and Output. Redefine the Standard.; System Foundations; Structural Generation; Computational Precision; Limitless Scaling; Information Architecture.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F0411A, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #F0411A, background #FFFFFF, surface #222222, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Arial for display moments and Arial for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>AERO - Creative Engine</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP & ScrollTrigger -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js for WebGL Animation -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        'brand-red': '#f0411a',\n                        'brand-cream': '#f4ece4',\n                        'brand-dark': '#0a0a0a'\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-brand-dark text-brand-cream font-sans overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-brand-red selection:text-white relative\">\n\n    <!-- Skill Directive: Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-50 flex justify-between px-8 max-w-[100vw]\">\n        <!-- Left Line -->\n        <div class=\"relative h-full w-[1px] hidden md:block\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 90%, transparent);\">\n            <!-- Corner Squares -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[1.5px] top-10 w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[1.5px] bottom-10 w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/20\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Right Line -->\n        <div class=\"relative h-full w-[1px] hidden md:block\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 90%, transparent);\">\n             <!-- Corner Squares -->\n             <div class=\"absolute -left-[1.5px] top-10 w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/20\"></div>\n             <div class=\"absolute -left-[1.5px] bottom-10 w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/20\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"bg-brand-red min-h-screen relative pt-8 px-6 md:px-12 flex flex-col overflow-hidden pb-12 md:pb-20\">\n\n        <!-- User Requested Matrix: Full Diagonal Lines & Specific Opacity Columns -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 flex w-full h-full pointer-events-none\">\n            <!-- Columns: 5% white, 3% white, 3% black -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 h-full bg-white/[0.05]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 h-full bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 h-full bg-black/[0.03]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Diagonal Lines Overlay -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 31px, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 31px, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 32px);\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <nav class=\"flex justify-between items-center z-40 relative w-full\">\n            <!-- Logo area -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-brand-cream\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" width=\"28\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Nav Links & CTA -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex bg-brand-cream text-brand-dark items-center px-2 py-1.5 rounded-full space-x-6 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"ml-4 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity\">Framework</a>\n                <span class=\"w-[1px] h-3 bg-brand-dark/20\"></span>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity\">Architecture</a>\n                <span class=\"w-[1px] h-3 bg-brand-dark/20\"></span>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity\">Showcase</a>\n\n                <!-- Skill Directive: Border Gradients -->\n                <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0)); padding: 1px; border-radius: 999px;\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-[#111] text-brand-cream px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full flex items-center space-x-1.5 hover:bg-[#222] transition-colors\">\n                        <span>Initialize</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Mobile Menu Icon -->\n            <button class=\"md:hidden text-brand-cream relative z-40\">\n                 <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" width=\"24\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Massive Typography Graphic & 3D Element -->\n        <div class=\"flex-1 relative flex justify-center items-center w-full z-20 mt-12 mb-8\">\n            <!-- Typography -->\n            <div class=\"text-[25vw] md:text-[22vw] leading-none font-black text-brand-cream tracking-tighter uppercase select-none opacity-90 z-10\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; transform: scaleY(0.9);\">\n                AERO\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- WebGL Container with Glass Filter Over Typography -->\n            <div id=\"webgl-canvas-container\" class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[280px] h-[280px] md:w-[450px] md:h-[450px] pointer-events-none z-30 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5 border border-white/20 shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Hero Content (Moved to Bottom) -->\n        <div class=\"max-w-4xl z-30 relative w-full\">\n\n            <p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-brand-dark bg-brand-cream inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-sm mb-6\">Built for Velocity</p>\n\n            <!-- Skill Directive: Masked Reveal applied via JS -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-brand-cream font-medium gs-reveal-text\">\n                Transform Workflows, Logic, and Output.<br class=\"hidden md:block\"> Redefine the Standard.\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-brand-cream/80 max-w-2xl mt-6 font-medium\">\n                Explore an infinite environment where advanced algorithms merge with fluid design. Architect, test, and deploy your digital models with unmatched speed and accuracy.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center space-y-4 sm:space-y-0 sm:space-x-4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-brand-cream text-brand-dark px-6 py-3 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium hover:bg-white transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto text-center\">\n                    Schedule Walkthrough\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-[#111] text-brand-cream px-6 py-3 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 hover:bg-[#222] transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto\">\n                    <span>View Framework</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Company Logos with Divider -->\n            <div class=\"mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-brand-cream/20 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6 w-full\">\n                <p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-brand-cream/70\">Empowering forward-thinking studios</p>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 md:gap-10 opacity-70\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:globus-linear\" width=\"24\" class=\"text-brand-cream\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" width=\"24\" class=\"text-brand-cream\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:ghost-linear\" width=\"24\" class=\"text-brand-cream\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:planet-linear\" width=\"24\" class=\"text-brand-cream\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-linear\" width=\"24\" class=\"text-brand-cream\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Content Columns Section -->\n    <section class=\"bg-brand-dark rounded-t-sm md:rounded-t-sm -mt-6 relative z-40 p-6 md:p-12 min-h-screen border-t border-white/5\">\n\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto mt-4 md:mt-12\">\n\n            <div class=\"mb-12\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight text-brand-cream font-medium\">System Foundations</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-brand-cream/60 max-w-xl mt-4 leading-relaxed\">Purpose-built mechanics engineered to convert intricate data structures into robust digital experiences seamlessly.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Text Layout with Columns & Lines -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 border-t border-b border-white/10 divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-white/10\">\n\n                <!-- Card 1 -->\n                <div class=\"p-8 md:p-10 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" width=\"32\" class=\"text-brand-red mb-8\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-medium text-brand-cream mb-4\">Structural Generation</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-brand-cream/70 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Assemble intricate models with deep control. The platform turns theoretical parameters into working architectures instantly.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2 -->\n                <div class=\"p-8 md:p-10 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-circle-linear\" width=\"32\" class=\"text-brand-red mb-8\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-medium text-brand-cream mb-4\">Computational Precision</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-brand-cream/70 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Rely on native logic systems to guarantee accuracy. Every element is calculated to preserve structural stability at scale.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3 -->\n                <div class=\"p-8 md:p-10 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" width=\"32\" class=\"text-brand-red mb-8\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-medium text-brand-cream mb-4\">Limitless Scaling</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-brand-cream/70 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Produce countless variations without losing speed. Navigate vast possibility spaces to find the optimal setup for your project.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                 <!-- Card 4 -->\n                 <div class=\"p-8 md:p-10 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm border-b md:border-b-0\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" width=\"32\" class=\"text-brand-red mb-8\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-medium text-brand-cream mb-4\">Information Architecture</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-brand-cream/70 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Map interconnected assets intuitively. The underlying framework adapts dynamically to your specific operational loads and constraints.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 5 -->\n                <div class=\"p-8 md:p-10 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm border-b md:border-b-0\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" width=\"32\" class=\"text-brand-red mb-8\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-medium text-brand-cream mb-4\">Encrypted Publishing</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-brand-cream/70 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Apply rigorous security protocols across environments. Retain complete ownership of your creative assets throughout the process.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 6 -->\n                <div class=\"p-8 md:p-10 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rocket-linear\" width=\"32\" class=\"text-brand-red mb-8\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-medium text-brand-cream mb-4\">Rapid Acceleration</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-brand-cream/70 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Boost deployment pipelines natively. Transition from abstract concepts to production-ready deliverables faster than ever.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- Masked Reveal Logic ---\n            const setupMaskedReveal = () => {\n                const revealTexts = document.querySelectorAll('.gs-reveal-text');\n\n                revealTexts.forEach(textEl => {\n                    const text = textEl.innerHTML;\n                    // Split handling simple break tags\n                    const parts = text.split(/(<br[^>]*>)/i);\n                    textEl.innerHTML = '';\n\n                    parts.forEach(part => {\n                        if (part.toLowerCase().startsWith('<br')) {\n                            textEl.innerHTML += part;\n                        } else {\n                            const words = part.split(' ').filter(w => w.trim() !== '');\n                            words.forEach(word => {\n                                // Create mask wrapper\n                                const maskSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                                maskSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                                maskSpan.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                                maskSpan.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                                maskSpan.style.paddingRight = '0.25em'; // Space between words\n                                maskSpan.style.lineHeight = '1.1';\n\n                                // Create inner animatable span\n                                const innerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                                innerSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                                innerSpan.className = 'word-inner';\n                                innerSpan.innerHTML = word;\n\n                                maskSpan.appendChild(innerSpan);\n                                textEl.appendChild(maskSpan);\n                            });\n                        }\n                    });\n\n                    // Animate the inner spans\n                    const innerWords = textEl.querySelectorAll('.word-inner');\n                    gsap.fromTo(innerWords,\n                        { y: '120%' },\n                        {\n                            y: '0%',\n                            duration: 1,\n                            ease: 'power4.out',\n                            stagger: 0.05,\n                            scrollTrigger: {\n                                trigger: textEl,\n                                start: 'top 95%',\n                            }\n                        }\n                    );\n                });\n            };\n\n            setupMaskedReveal();\n\n            // --- WebGL Animation Logic (Three.js) ---\n            const initWebGL = () => {\n                const container = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas-container');\n                if (!container) return;\n\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n                // Camera setup\n                const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n                camera.position.z = 5;\n\n                // Renderer setup\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n                renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n                container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n                // Lighting setup for shaded material\n                const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.6);\n                scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n                const dirLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 1.5);\n                dirLight.position.set(5, 5, 5);\n                scene.add(dirLight);\n\n                const accentLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xf0411a, 0.8);\n                accentLight.position.set(-5, -5, -2);\n                scene.add(accentLight);\n\n                // Create geometric shape with solid shading\n                const geometry = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(1.3, 1);\n\n                const material = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                    color: 0xf4ece4,\n                    roughness: 0.2,\n                    metalness: 0.3,\n                    flatShading: true\n                });\n\n                const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n                scene.add(mesh);\n\n                // Animation loop\n                const animate = () => {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                    // Rotate the object\n                    mesh.rotation.x += 0.002;\n                    mesh.rotation.y += 0.003;\n\n                    // Floating effect\n                    const time = Date.now() * 0.001;\n                    mesh.position.y = Math.sin(time) * 0.1;\n\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                };\n\n                animate();\n\n                // Handle resize\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    if(!container) return;\n                    camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n                });\n            };\n\n            // Initialize WebGL slightly delayed to ensure DOM dimensions are ready\n            setTimeout(initWebGL, 100);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aero-creative-engine-3.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aero-creative-engine-3.jpg", "source_name": "aero-creative-engine-3-DESIGN.md", "views": 287, "forks": 17, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T10:56:04.442843+00:00"}